{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12661","headline":"漫歌八曲 大回中 · 元结","name":"漫歌八曲 大回中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"樊水欲东流，大江又北来。\n樊山当其南，此中爲大回。\n回中鱼好游，回中多钓舟。\n漫欲作渔人，终焉无所求。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元结","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12661.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12661","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}